{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944840/extras/da04b04bb2ef0a77a6b68914859c187e.webp?t=1767285229\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944840/extras/da04b04bb2ef0a77a6b68914859c187e.poster.avif?t=1767285229\" class=\"bb_img\" width=854 height=50 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Researchers at the Black Hole Observatory Station made a discovery that could change our understanding of the universe forever. But before the data could be transmitted, the station went silent. An emergency lockdown was triggered, and the last logs reported something\u2026 unnatural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission:</strong> secure the Black Box containing the research data, and escape the abandoned station alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important Note:</strong> Last security logs indicate multiple strange anomalies lurking the station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944840/extras/b95520eec9e6dfabc20394655ef712ea.poster.avif?t=1767285229\" width=780 height=393 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944840/extras/b95520eec9e6dfabc20394655ef712ea.webm?t=1767285229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944840/extras/9e7c1aef526ca5ed4bf945466f5cd4ce.webp?t=1767285229\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944840/extras/9e7c1aef526ca5ed4bf945466f5cd4ce.poster.avif?t=1767285229\" class=\"bb_img\" width=854 height=50 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Solo or Co-Op (1\u20134 Players)</i></strong> \u2013 Face the horror alone, or join forces with your crew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Proximity Voice Chat</i></strong> \u2013 Communication only works when you\u2019re near your teammates. Stay together, or risk isolation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944840/extras/4d19404a04fca8bfcfcd7187c3fb68f8.poster.avif?t=1767285229\" width=780 height=321 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944840/extras/4d19404a04fca8bfcfcd7187c3fb68f8.webm?t=1767285229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944840/extras/d4141b610efb7f34f9f2f17303312f28.webp?t=1767285229\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944840/extras/d4141b610efb7f34f9f2f17303312f28.poster.avif?t=1767285229\" class=\"bb_img\" width=854 height=50 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Anomalies Lurk Within</strong></i> \u2013 Strange entities now roam the corridors of the station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Survive the Station</strong></i> \u2013 Reactivate failing systems, search for clues, and navigate the dark environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Will you escape with the data\u2026 or be lost to the black hole forever?</strong></i></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\